{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo of \u201cLast Mage\u201d includes the first two maps and offers about 25 minutes of the game-play. <strong>Fight hordes of monsters spilling out of the dungeon with spells and content of your backpack.</strong> Mix and match between 10 spells and their upgrades to use magic resources most effectively, find equipment during expeditions and then craft more powerful items, use properties and shapes of discovered bags to improve your chance for survival. You can get a glimpse of the skill tree as a way to permanently upgrade your skills and lexicon, where you will keep all your knowledge about encountered monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i>Once, mages shaped the world\u2014until fear turned us into prey. I fled, I hid, but magic leaves a mark. They found me, dragged me from exile, and cast me into the depths.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The whispers here speak of old powers, of horrors never meant to be freed. If I am to survive, I must be precise. Every spell, every artifact, and every choice matters.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Magic still lingers in the dark\u2026 but so does something else.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/235e37a8109907d04c52bb1524ba7382.poster.avif?t=1758718883\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/235e37a8109907d04c52bb1524ba7382.webm?t=1758718883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/bdc7263af3eb952d917727eb09c83cd0.avif?t=1758718883\" data-has-big width=1600 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight your way through the hordes of monsters emerging from the underground.</i> <br><br>Obligated with an almost impossible task, you must <strong>descend into the catacombs</strong> of the desecrated temple to eliminate this calamity. <br><br>Your motivation? Getting your <strong>freedom back</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/60ff4b94e87ba8c64791f9aca4efd8b5.avif?t=1758718883\" data-has-big width=1600 height=526 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/bf8ce272e9ea99ae1df4b408a12bce41.avif?t=1758718883\" data-has-big width=1600 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Not only the arrangement of items is crucial, but backpack parts itself as well!</i> <br><br><br><strong>Tailor your backpack</strong> to your strategy, choosing which skills will ensure your survival. <br><strong>Unlock new backpack blocks</strong> and make your inventory even more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/7261d9759fb5cf0492445bdf754985e7.avif?t=1758718883\" width=780 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/34cc656e83e93e26b6cd8c9f4355e203.avif?t=1758718883\" data-has-big width=1600 height=199 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The dungeon is a dangerous place. Luckily, you're also hazardous with a whole arsenal of spells.</i>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your starting rune</strong> and come down to face the monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn experience</strong> with each horror fallen and <strong>pick new spells</strong> as you level up. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just <strong>mind your mana</strong>. You may be powerful, but magic is not an infinite resource.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/4aca72d014023319ade14415f71eb44b.avif?t=1758718883\" width=780 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/416217d3ed9ece2e83ca3663c3fd627f.avif?t=1758718883\" data-has-big width=1600 height=199 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some unfortunate souls fell here before you, trying to remedy monster plague. Let's not let their equipment go to waste.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up new items</strong> when you defeat tougher enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test new arrangements</strong> of the items to find the most lethal one; just be careful. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical artifacts tend to <strong>interact with each other</strong> and sometimes create something even more dangerous.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/a729587b707be62237bfe08b3399d606.avif?t=1758718883\" width=780 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/85d9bc39db4f87f44b8cc3f7fd259c77.avif?t=1758718883\" data-has-big width=1600 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use experience earned with each descent to <strong>develop your skills</strong> in the skill tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contrary to popular belief, <strong>magic also requires a lot of stamina</strong>. And strength. And speed. And\u2026 You probably get it already.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/extras/0355501504261a0b5c9a60b95a4334c8.avif?t=1758718883\" data-has-big width=1600 height=526 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883450?t=1758718883","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883450?t=1758718883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/b3e8a594cd5dd3051f0a2552e5f28e56bd26df22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758718883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883450/b3e8a594cd5dd3051f0a2552e5f28e56bd26df22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758718883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo of \u201cLast Mage\u201d includes the first two maps and offers about 25 minutes of the game-play. <strong>Fight 